Annotation to edax_d10_phase.journal and edax_d10_phase.log (run of 12 Nov at db0f5ee).
The raw journal and log are unchanged.

Game 10:1 ended at 26 empties with the engine (black) wiped out, 0 discs to 38.
It never reached 24, 20 or 14 empties, so neither solver was asked about it.
Its record
    10:1  points 0.0000 discs -38 v24 -38 v20 -38 v14 -38
carries the analyser's early-terminal fallback: v24, v20 and v14 are the raw
final disc margin (-38), not solver values. With empties given to the winner the
exact margin is -64. Only the sign is used by the W/D/L counts, intervals and
changes, so those are unaffected.

The other 199 games have solver values at all three checkpoints, and at 14
empties Edax's value and our own solver's agreed on all 199.
